#: scenario:scenario_B85E47A8_2A5C_4EAB_B10B_A58D1633E893
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d562422fea5410fcc5c5f54f2d33a35bf1f1c86f20ba4dd9d1085c6aa0aa0cb
#. default-sha256: 8af2d1d260090ad585a49dc081ab154f39dd1c31861d4d92eac8fea4d9074378
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B85E47A8_2A5C_4EAB_B10B_A58D1633E893"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫Slowly but surely, time trekked onward, everyone working toward their own individual goals."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫Lentement mais sûrement, le temps s’écoula, tandis que chacun vaquait à ses occupations."

#: scenario:scenario_D2036877_CB64_4A97_8B0F_4D65C53B3156
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1a8ba7c1cfe0b16dd07ae2b9011ea36b817520734f7b10ae07c8d9506f07b95b
#. default-sha256: 81e7dc6393e565bccdf8cea7975809205f4aef31adac7ac3504e5a2c59142dd6
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D2036877_CB64_4A97_8B0F_4D65C53B3156"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Each early-summer breeze that blew through the garden was like God’s hallowed breath "
"carrying the flowers’ fragrance in through Rose Manor’s windows."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Chaque brise matinale caressant le jardin, tel le souffle béni de Dieu, charriait l’arôme "
"des fleurs jusque dans le manoir."

#: scenario:scenario_9A4DE7BB_0C12_411E_AE8C_2E488320BDE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59736e57b9e9a8ac9d531ab3f7fbef194225dde699b3e99ecc2ab92efe4d01f5
#. default-sha256: 68e186bc073a787d516dfd3d47e6ef83b87d8e27854924e83bd4f46da9165c7d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_9A4DE7BB_0C12_411E_AE8C_2E488320BDE2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If only time could be stopped, and this beautiful era made to live on through eternity."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Si seulement on pouvait arrêter le temps et faire durer pour l’éternité cette belle époque."

#: scenario:scenario_C8801846_7252_4B91_84FD_916BE74A68A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7e5075f25a150bab899062fe855e339f95e7f355c64db433b24ed317448e13f4
#. default-sha256: 4b1126d7917a806066c1a0c605baf396c4664e257ca02baaaedc0d82ecead8d3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C8801846_7252_4B91_84FD_916BE74A68A7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As usual, Mell’s eyes chased after the White-Haired Girl, and Nellie pursed her lips in "
"frustration at him. ⟪k:1⟫But she was still rather docile."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Comme d’habitude, Mell poursuivait de ses assauts la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs et Nellie se "
"mordait les lèvres de frustration. ⟪k:1⟫Mais elle était encore assez docile."

#: scenario:scenario_413EE96A_C6D7_4B31_8421_5DE9B5B6592E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3d6cf628c17096069a20c528d26e2a6a0872004edee604fe0400f1c719d1d0cc
#. default-sha256: 494b9b6a702eca39a0b91de41726b5c98f9a45e46e3e7fb2d31efbfb10ccedd2
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_413EE96A_C6D7_4B31_8421_5DE9B5B6592E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Even taking into account how self-centered she behaved, how fickle her temper, Nellie’s fits "
"were still no worse than a playful kitten."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫On avait beau prendre en compte son narcissisme et son tempérament inconstant, les crises de "
"Nellie n’étaient guère plus que les coups de patte d’un chaton joueur."

#: scenario:scenario_5D308507_DC8D_4784_9099_C7E5E1924E30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 919537eb69ef88945110d9d466b672dee9bf66c7ca2db28b6fe06ab80b121dcf
#. default-sha256: d51e4c505328eb992b3ee135ab0faba0ce1cb37e69967c35a0cfe36d3355e407
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_5D308507_DC8D_4784_9099_C7E5E1924E30"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫See? At that very moment, our lively little feline had her claws poised to swat at the "
"flaxen-haired young man."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Vous voyez ? ⟪k:1⟫À⟪k:2⟫ ce moment précis, notre petite tigresse pleine de vie avait ses "
"griffes prêtes à bondir sur le jeune homme aux cheveux blonds."

#: scenario:scenario_FD95A642_51F8_40B0_8FBA_93F6CCA6FA16
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2286c09f482169ed69467e107df6b18862a6645b5ef02f93ea521d3e14d196ac
#. default-sha256: 0e25bf5ee3efa74a9a635d74d240687605a0daba338866fb412131fabd856f31
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_FD95A642_51F8_40B0_8FBA_93F6CCA6FA16"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hehehe."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Héhéhé."

#: scenario:scenario_DBE9B976_12DB_4DBB_8E83_7FC83F259946
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6da80d35d7be28c06f52a9e20ac224d666df653fbc3cb7a83e230cde31f20c1
#. default-sha256: 213a45174b23b974f87b05c3a6c0630657f15da6b84439551fb19d888d58a3ce
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_DBE9B976_12DB_4DBB_8E83_7FC83F259946"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Mell!⟪k:9⟫You promised me!⟪k:10⟫Or have you "
"forgotten?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Mell !⟪k:9⟫Tu m’avais promis !⟪k:10⟫Ou bien aurais-"
"tu oublié ?!"

#: scenario:scenario_DD3F9AE7_91E2_400A_8840_9D8ED4C66C53
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dc1bbe2fc7647b7b380ba1eeb4eb62534302b126ba3e285c94026a4cb962419c
#. default-sha256: a8d8b64fdb3dd7ddacff723e3c8d4d64870625b66ac7046f965526f7bf7cf098
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_DD3F9AE7_91E2_400A_8840_9D8ED4C66C53"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I haven’t forgotten, I’m just asking if we can go another day."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Je n’ai pas oublié, je te demande juste si on ne peut pas y aller un autre jour."

#: scenario:scenario_DB64EEF5_3153_4721_80BE_6A8D3C452F51
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 68aed214d1422b500666d96798bff0762a544c0b4284b1ac62371ec7d551e167
#. default-sha256: 00c95d1bb441019c00b532f5c4d0989c8beec1cbb2b06e6bdac5fc0a17dcbf1c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_DB64EEF5_3153_4721_80BE_6A8D3C452F51"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Another day?⟪k:3⟫ This isn’t something that happens every day!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I’ve been "
"looking forward to tonight’s performance for so long."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Un autre jour ?⟪k:3⟫ Mais ça n’a pas lieu tous les jours !⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Ça fait "
"longtemps que j’attends de voir le spectacle de ce soir."

#: scenario:scenario_64CBF9EE_F404_48E3_BA36_662BC330EF22
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 095a7a908d48e5eb0f153832a41e23959de72c64182abbe9443dd61b672342da
#. default-sha256: 0ad9563f2d6f60d473f82fd99e4b7ccc703258fe8991efc72670cebff8e65692
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_64CBF9EE_F404_48E3_BA36_662BC330EF22"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫There’s nothing I can do about that. We’re having a gathering at the priest’s home "
"tonight. ⟪k:2⟫Several high-ranking officials have come up from the mainland just for this."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Je n’y peux rien. On a une réunion au presbytère ce soir... ⟪k:2⟫Des responsables de "
"haut rang viennent exprès du continent."

#: scenario:scenario_A4ED2DE1_002E_4D59_91D2_FDE757FC6D54
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b67df7a10f32bbcc67d613dd5659856866c0e0e5894cb20f48d802072853cb1b
#. default-sha256: 49a7682347c8fb481b9bb35d09c5273219cd94313f943089951bfa57f7a33efd
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A4ED2DE1_002E_4D59_91D2_FDE757FC6D54"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Who cares?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫On s’en moque !"

#: scenario:scenario_2ECAF814_92B5_4FCA_9A2C_BA4FE44F2586
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e68806b43976e64279cbd81c8bbd81bf428c6ae2b49d5c4d9fd58af9e1322c77
#. default-sha256: 996781647aba364179e59f15f104a21338eb87df6d26e28859abf2fa8f40b5be
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2ECAF814_92B5_4FCA_9A2C_BA4FE44F2586"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I-⟪k:2⟫I care...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You know, Nellie... ⟪k:5⟫it doesn’t ⟪k:6⟫have⟪k:7⟫ to be me "
"who goes with you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫P-⟪k:2⟫Pas moi...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Tu sais, Nellie... ⟪k:5⟫tu n’es pas ⟪k:6⟫obligée⟪k:7⟫ d’y "
"aller avec moi."

#: scenario:scenario_01CE9B15_4BDF_445A_B799_9227D376C28C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe9c728bc969f75c52447b80d09882723ba6700e4f960185a81523c2053f1bec
#. default-sha256: 54214d48ea4f70124513111cc2df44f44aa1d5c972c5c80e8ef1f2495ef79059
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_01CE9B15_4BDF_445A_B799_9227D376C28C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫No! I want to go with you, Mell!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Non ! Je veux y aller avec toi, Mell !"

#: scenario:scenario_C8F83018_7993_4DEB_87D4_A32FD1F60C4A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7eeb4c8bc192ced7340e10def81b31d491e182acf3a40ad9c283f79844f4c3b9
#. default-sha256: a51ada8feffb9beecc70ffdf1bf7af064e84a38ebca43bbd81da442fdb8f3419
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C8F83018_7993_4DEB_87D4_A32FD1F60C4A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You’ve been so distant lately, dearest Mell.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You refuse to do anything with "
"me..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Tu as été si distant dernièrement, très cher.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Tu refuses de faire quoi que ce "
"soit avec moi..."

#: scenario:scenario_1B36894A_FFC7_4F9A_B2F9_50D0F1E37722
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 36b99d2f879f15c7d2987ff0ea740b078a9cae9a3495d377dcd666e15e5b81d6
#. default-sha256: c306b85b1c4fe5cb5f0d8c98ef87b65bbc5d3a55463208c0177457afa81a8e85
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1B36894A_FFC7_4F9A_B2F9_50D0F1E37722"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That’s not true."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ce n’est pas vrai."

#: scenario:scenario_0B4E29E2_F75F_4C33_B0C7_FB7A63F16B56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2d758bd6532450964fbbdee00a3dd6481b4412b72a5dd14445559123d9451833
#. default-sha256: c48f8e49d58d233cd4e5b36383e2e4386b7a96fdf8364ad2c90d018a8d57b363
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0B4E29E2_F75F_4C33_B0C7_FB7A63F16B56"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Tell me—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫if you can’t go today, when ⟪k:4⟫can⟪k:5⟫ you?⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫When will you "
"be willing to go out with me?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Dis-moi juste—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫si tu ne ⟪k:4⟫peux⟪k:5⟫ pas aujourd’hui, quand alors ?⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"Quand accepteras-tu d’y aller avec moi ?"

#: scenario:scenario_4C33E21F_95D7_4D67_A60C_4A7B5FA336B8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: af736a12455054a7bd2fd43490af591bba40c2c68116e686a6cde5fbe11a61f6
#. default-sha256: c6abcc8e75164e05c1503dd376e92b78f0b739b9b5a5ebf7431f402ebd109e7b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4C33E21F_95D7_4D67_A60C_4A7B5FA336B8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫When will you be willing to play cards with me?⟪k:1⟫To have tea together?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quand voudras-tu jouer aux cartes avec moi ?⟪k:1⟫Ou qu’on prenne le thé tous les deux ?"

#: scenario:scenario_9385E4E7_E567_4872_B6EA_244B62C0B2D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 843cf9ce9b3d5d3a10023812528bf8759b903e5da253f9253ba57d6e8a7b14c4
#. default-sha256: 027b2aed374c403e9aa0e9943561295df7cd97221edd5f930f35dd26299946eb
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_9385E4E7_E567_4872_B6EA_244B62C0B2D2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I... ⟪k:2⟫can’t make any promises.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I have things to do—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫obligations."
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫And Nellie, you’re almost an adult yourself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Je... ⟪k:2⟫ne peux rien te promettre.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫J’ai des choses à faire—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫ des "
"obligations.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Et puis, Nellie, tu es quasiment adulte toi aussi."

#: scenario:scenario_A39F153A_73C7_459B_B747_63D03965ADA6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e5bf624941f15f330ab028dd9f6d40789614f335c9273fe0bee3adc21d87e8c8
#. default-sha256: 398ebf9b3e6586a41da99a22cfb61d4d96633df3824e715492adf5cc1baace1b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A39F153A_73C7_459B_B747_63D03965ADA6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Stop acting like such a child."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Arrête de te comporter en enfant."

#: scenario:scenario_353CAC4C_8617_486B_855D_4297A1FFF2F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e78ac0194ee19b20b3a33b6d8bba4c34ffa104ee1043c6c7df386b868396f204
#. default-sha256: 578371d686f4f6bfff1282792d468b1c046643ff1bac49c1cca4692ddb6b5d07
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_353CAC4C_8617_486B_855D_4297A1FFF2F9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I’m not an adult yet!⟪k:2⟫I’m still a kid!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Je ne suis pas encore adulte !⟪k:2⟫Je suis toujours une enfant !"

#: scenario:scenario_37C57A29_53DC_4562_B66A_6A46209983BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 455df91159c81ab75077fdff23f59f7d14bcae86b219dc2bccadb65e8fd32044
#. default-sha256: 834cf9942d34846480a5115f13f8c9d1d7cf387e853059813e2a9ef94bef98a4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_37C57A29_53DC_4562_B66A_6A46209983BF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫If it means I don’t get to play with you anymore,⟪k:2⟫dearest Mell, then I don’t ⟪k:3⟫"
"want⟪k:4⟫ to be an adult!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Si c’est pour ne plus jouer avec toi,⟪k:2⟫mon cher Mell, alors je ne ⟪k:3⟫veux⟪k:4⟫ pas "
"être une adulte !"

#: scenario:scenario_C6699785_C044_4576_A771_11C8207F6A24
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0a00b6f3ace23e622bcbbbfced80ec5a5732d0be03637555d1738a315012b228
#. default-sha256: d7e7bd5e7b3e585880e5ca65310fcb00b70b85a64c890c083a555f2988115590
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C6699785_C044_4576_A771_11C8207F6A24"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nellie, you can’t—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nellie, tu ne peux pas—"

#: scenario:scenario_7A37DB7D_81BA_4ED5_9A41_CBA0CCEDC531
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
